0.4.0:
- Operators can set timeout, width, and height when sending a
  notification to a machine.

- Operators can restart the daemon from the machine admin page.

- Operators can download a machine's audits file. YAML audits are
  converted to JSON before upload.

- Operators can download a machine's critical error log.

- Operators can download a snapshot of the daemon journal.

- Machines send an activity log to the server: player login, token
  rotation, server commands, score uploads, and daemon
  start/restart/shutdown. Operators can view it from the machine
  admin page.

- Builds can target local, stage, or live with -DSSB_ENV.
